It tries to give you an unknown spellbook.  *Read* one of them,
and then it will go from Plain to Blank and that will become
a known type.  Then the algorythm that produces unknown
spellbooks will go past Blank and give you other types until it
"runs out" of unknown ones and just gives random books.  "Runs
out" is something like it tries your XP level times before
giving you a random one.  XP maxes out at 30 and there are more
than that many types of spellbooks, so it is never guaranteed
to get all types.

